      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
      "body": "In the previous stable release of flutter (1.22.6) the cupertino scrollbar could be flung giving it some inertia just like the real scrollbar on iOS.\r\nAfter the refactor done in #71664 this behavior was accidentally removed.\r\n\r\nIn pr #78689 I added a widget test for this behavior that passes on 1.22.6 and fails on the current master and stable channels",
